      "id": "claim_dcadaa9aa47c4ad4abaf4c85b10f427c",
      "statement": "The HTTP enqueue path POST /sessions/:id/prompt applies identity enforcement (author from the verified principal — user → canonical id, bot → asserted actor, actorless bot prompts anonymous), validates the body and attachment references (max 6 per message), strips callbackContext from unauthorized principals, resolves canonical user id and GitHub enrichment for non-anonymous authors via resolveGitHubEnrichmentForRequest under resolveGitHubCredentialAuthority, then forwards an EnqueuePromptRequest to the DO's internal /internal/prompt path and touches the session index updated_at in the background.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/control-plane/src/routes/session-prompt.ts#L50-L178",
