      "statement": "The DO message queue dispatch is re-entrancy guarded by the processing-message claim: it takes the next pending message (FIFO, so prompts submitted while a turn runs queue), resolves the model and provider authentication, and when no sandbox WebSocket is connected broadcasts sandbox_spawning and spawns the sandbox in the background with the message staying persisted-pending until the sandbox socket connects.",
