      "id": "claim_7aa2a1b0d8e14f94993965c20d9bc02a",
      "statement": "Dispatch builds the prompt SandboxCommand (messageId, content, resolved model and validated reasoning effort, author git identity, stored attachments), claims the message processing (also inserting the user message event), sends it over the sandbox WebSocket, then broadcasts the user message event and processing_status:true, refreshes the prompt-queue broadcast, updates last activity, arms the execution timeout alarm sharing the DO's single alarm slot, and fires callback.notify_started; a failed send reverts the message to pending and terminates the unresponsive sandbox.",
