      "statement": "The bridge runs the prompt command as a background task so the WebSocket listener stays responsive to other commands (stop, push, ack) and prompt tasks survive WS disconnects; its done-callback emits a failed execution_complete for cancelled or excepted tasks and requests a diff refresh on success.",
