      "statement": "bridge _handle_prompt parses the explicit git identity and configures signing, creates the OpenCode session on first use, processes attachments (invalid ones emit a media warning), streams OpenCode SSE via OpenCodePromptStream, treats 'no output emitted' as an error, and emits the terminal execution_complete {messageId, success} event including on errors.",
