      "id": "claim_d535e8e2022548359b7ab58b845ab0fc",
      "statement": "BufferedEventForwarder owns reconnect-safe delivery: a bounded 1000-event buffer that evicts non-critical events first, critical events (execution_complete, error, snapshot_ready, push_complete, push_error) carrying an ackId and staying pending until the DO acknowledges, and bind() recovering the backlog exactly once under a recovery lock.",
