      "id": "claim_c01ed79730da41b8ae887f67890a40b1",
      "statement": "stopExecution fails the processing message, marks it awaiting stop confirmation with a STOP_CONFIRMATION_TIMEOUT_MS = 15-second deadline and schedules the alarm, broadcasts processing_status:false plus a synthetic execution_complete so clients flush buffered tokens, and forwards {type:\"stop\"} to the sandbox; if the sandbox never confirms before the deadline, recoverStopConfirmationTimeout terminates the unresponsive sandbox and resumes the queue, and a stop send failure terminates the sandbox immediately.",
